	quest.42000000000F0242.quest_desc: [
		"Logs around a Binding Knot, Thread on top. Place it on the pad.",
		"Stand near it: the pad starts mending you once a Strand is seated.",
		"The Nine Tribes left provisions for the next Clowder. Use a Steward Cache to unwrap random supplies, or craft four small caches into a medium and three mediums into a large. Larger seals hold more rolls and a broader supply pool; opening separately gives more basic supplies. No machines, progression tokens or extra lives hide inside.",
		"How: make or find Raise the Post. JEI names the recipe; earlier quests in this chapter name the station and inputs."
	]
