	]
	quest.4200000000220536.title: "Pulse Cell"
	quest.4200000000220537.quest_desc: [
		"Seat a reusable Echo catalyst; add two different totem voices within eight blocks. A scattered heap counts at most five voices. A Voice Ring of totems at radius 3 is what six-voice resonance now means. Redstone pauses it.",
		"How: seat an Echo catalyst, two different totems within 8. Redstone pauses it."
	]
